# Proxy API calls through our own domain instead of calling the Render
# backend directly from the browser. This makes every /api/* request
# same-origin from the browser's point of view, so the session cookie is
# a first-party cookie (not a cross-site one) — this is what fixes people
# getting logged out on refresh, since some browsers restrict or block
# cookies set by a different domain than the page they're on, even with
# SameSite=None; Secure configured correctly. Must come before the SPA
# catch-all below — Netlify uses the first matching rule.
/api/*  https://zuri-backend-4tzh.onrender.com/api/:splat  200

/*  /index.html  200
